From 20c4db18a6c86bdb4483e513fdfddbeb36bbb1c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 10:42:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/31] a210: vendor import: 50-dt-bindings

Cherry-picked vendor enablement group 50 (50-dt-bindings) onto Linux v6.6.141 as
the maintained A210 LTS branch (one commit per kernel/patches group). Applied
with git apply --recount; reconciled against vendor branch osl/a210-v2.9.0.
See kernel/patches/README.md and kernel/T2-DESIGN.md for group rationale.

Signed-off-by: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>

v7.0 port: took upstream for all binding docs that upstream now maintains
(plic, dwcmshc, dwmac, th1520-pinctrl/-pwm/-reset, clint) and accepted
upstream\x27s removal of the legacy rtc/xgene-rtc.txt. Binding YAML is docs
only (dt_binding_check); A210 DT compatibles bind regardless.

Signed-off-by: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
